{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-1-e18","title":"俭钦进退失据众心沮散","order":5515,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-1-e18","label":"正文","text":"俭钦进退失据众心沮散","evidence":["wgc-q0230","wgc-q0019"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0048","role":"进退失据、众溃","evidence":["wgc-q0230","wgc-q0019"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0074","role":"进退失据","evidence":["wgc-q0230","wgc-q0019"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0230","wgc-q0019"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0230"}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0048","name":"毌丘俭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0074","name":"文钦","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0019","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a7edad975718e7be6c83","layer":"original","quote":"大将军统中外军，讨之；别使诸葛诞督豫州诸军，从安风津拟寿春〖1〗，征东将军胡遵督青、徐诸军出于谯、宋之间〖2〗，绝其归路。大将军屯汝阳〖3〗，使监军王基督前锋诸军据南顿以待之〖4〗。令诸军皆坚壁勿与战。俭、钦进不得斗，退恐寿春见袭，不得归，计穷不知所为。淮南将士，家皆在北，众心沮散，降者相属，惟淮南新附农民为之用。大将军遣兖州刺史邓艾督泰山诸军万余人至乐嘉〖5〗，示弱以诱之，大将军寻自（洙）〔汝阳〕至。钦不知，果夜来欲袭艾等；会明，见大军兵马盛，乃引还。﹝一﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":121,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":232,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0230","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a7edad975718e7be6c83","layer":"original","quote":"俭、钦进不得斗，退恐寿春见袭，不得归，计穷不知所为。淮南将士，家皆在北，众心沮散，降者相属，惟淮南新附农民为之用","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":121,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":101,"end":157,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
